# =============================================================================
#  WayPoint - .gitignore
#  Keeps firmware, tools, logged sessions and docs; drops OS / editor / tool junk and
#  everything a compiler, simulator or package manager can regenerate.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Local-only stuff (submission zips, scratch, secrets) -------------------
_archive/
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.h
**/secrets/
*.pem

